      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.tshaonline.org/handbook/entries/berclair-tx"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Even into the mid‑1980s, Berclair continued to supply surrounding ranches, keeping its rural roots alive.",
